fig:PlotPointsOnly Example of points plotted on coordinate axes.
fig:PlotPointsLine The line of best fit has now been superimposed on the points in Figure \\@ref(fig:PlotPointsOnly).
fig:PlotPtsLnRes The distances between each observed $y_i$ and fitted $\\hat{y}_{i}$ from Figure \\@ref(fig:PlotPointsLine).
h3:measures-of-linear-relationship Measures of Linear Relationship
fig:examplePositiveCorr An illustration of strong negative correlation ($r_{xy} \\approx +1$).
fig:exampleNegaticeCorr An illustration of strong negative correlation ($r_{xy} \\approx -1$).
fig:exampleNoCorr An illustration of no correlation ($r_{xy} \\approx 0$).
h3:sse-ssr-and-sst SSE, SSR and SST
fig:SSEregression An illustration of $y_i - \\hat{y}_{i}$. when these distances are squared and added together, we get the SSE.
fig:SSRregression An illustration of $y_i - \\bar{y}$. when these distances are squared and added together, we get the SSR.
fig:SSTregression An illustration of $\\hat{y}_i - \\bar{y}$. when these distances are squared and added together, we get the SST.
